  "productSlug": "ecwid",
  "shortDescription": "Ecwid (Lightspeed) is a hosted ecommerce widget you embed on an existing website, WordPress, or social storefront rather than replacing the CMS. US tiles after the 2 March 2026 update: Starter $5/mo; Venture $35/mo or $29 annual; Business $65/mo or $49 annual; Unlimited $149/mo or $119 annual. Ecwid does not add its own transaction fee on top of payment processing. Landscape SaaS peer — not a Shopify-class commerce OS. Research grounded 2026-08-18 from first-party pricing; confirm live on ecwid.com/pricing.",
